ig noah out of the pit she fell into i  never  [Music]  she channeled her feelings into lyrics  and began working on her first album the  hardest part which is set to release on  september 16th  [Music]  music's played a big part of noah's  entire life but especially last year  when she nabbed a nomination for best  new artist at the grammys i'm trying to  keep i'm trying to remember that i like  how  special this is for me for every single  artist here that we each need to  personally recognize  that we all need to just live in this  moment and recognize that like  we did that we made the music we got us  to this point and that's just something  that like i am so grateful for and  i'm just so blessed to be here and as  noah navigates her recovery she says  she's in no way trying to be a  spokesperson for it quote i myself am  just going through it and figuring it  out i wake up in the morning and i'm  able to look in the mirror and go on  about my day without hating myself i'm  able to comfort myself and nurture  myself
 

